% covers: 11 - header names in any case: host:, x-splatcrab-token: and CONTENT-TYPE: answer 200 OK, and so do HOST:, X-SPLATCRAB-TOKEN:, content-type: and content-length:
POST /api HTTP/1.1
host: 127.0.0.1:8123
x-splatcrab-token: test-token
CONTENT-TYPE: application/json
Content-Length: 39

{"id":1,"op":"eval","code":"x = 1 + 2"}
POST /api HTTP/1.1
HOST: 127.0.0.1:8123
X-SPLATCRAB-TOKEN: test-token
content-type: application/json
content-length: 41

{"id":2,"op":"eval","code":"disp(x * 2)"}
